  "description": "REQUIRED: Combat LV40+\n\nRaid Schedule (Times are in EST/UTC−5):\n•04:00\n•12:00\n•20:00\n\nHello all, welcome to Eden.\n\nThis is simple, low maintenance guild, just be active daily, donate to challenges when you can, and join for raids when possible.\n\nIs very important to donate to challenges so we can raid for easy rewards. If you need buy from Market for some item you do not have, please do if you can. Even if you donate just 10 of an item, every little bit helps.\n\nIdle on, friends.\n\nNo contribution for 3 day = Kick\n\nFounded on 26.8.2024",
